---
import BaseLayout from "../../../components/layout/BaseLayout.astro";
import MetaPill from "../../../components/ui/MetaPill.astro";
import registry from "../../../data/phase-95-infrastructure-construction-buildings-public-works-territorial-systems-delivery-registry.json";
const territorial = registry.spatial_planning_land_assembly_rights_of_way_site_readiness_dossiers;
const projects = registry.project_design_engineering_cost_estimation_permitting_procurement_ledgers;
const construction = registry.construction_contractors_trades_materials_safety_inspection_registers;
const stewardship = registry.commissioning_accessibility_asset_handover_operations_maintenance_adaptation_reconstruction_territorial_value_ledgers;
---

<BaseLayout title="Infrastructure, Construction, Buildings, Public Works And Territorial Systems | FTFN" description="Thirty-two inactive territorial-readiness, project-definition, construction-delivery, and asset-stewardship records.">
  <section class="page-section hero" data-infrastructure-construction-territorial-systems-registry><div class="hero__copy"><div class="eyebrow">FTFN / Territorial Delivery</div><h1 class="page-title">A capital plan is not an executable project, and substantial completion is not safe accessible service.</h1><p class="lede">Phase 95 traces spatial plans, land assembly, rights of way and site readiness; design, engineering, estimates, permits and procurement; contractors, trades, materials, safety and inspection; then commissioning, accessibility, handover, operations, maintenance, climate adaptation, reconstruction, community recovery and territorial value.</p><div class="meta-row"><MetaPill label="8 inactive territorial dossiers" tone="possibility" /><MetaPill label="8 inactive project ledgers" /><MetaPill label="8 inactive construction registers" /><MetaPill label="8 inactive stewardship ledgers" /><MetaPill label="0 territorial-delivery decisions" tone="review" /></div></div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Planning, Land, Rights Of Way And Site Readiness</div><h2>Eight territorial-readiness dossiers remain closed.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/spatial-planning-land-assembly-rights-of-way-site-readiness-001/">Read the territorial-readiness guide</a></div><div class="grid">{territorial.map((record) => <article class="record-card"><div class="meta-row"><MetaPill label={record.territorial_state} tone="review" /><MetaPill label="20 inactive gates" /></div><h3><a href={'/evidence/infrastructure-construction-buildings-public-works-territorial-systems/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Plans, parcels, title, tenure, easements, site control, utilities, rights, environment, anti-displacement, review and receipts remain empty.</p></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Project Definition, Design, Permitting And Procurement</div><h2>Eight project ledgers contain no deliverability decision.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/project-definition-design-engineering-cost-estimation-001/">Read the project-definition guide</a></div><div class="grid">{projects.map((record) => <article class="record-card"><div class="meta-row"><MetaPill label={record.project_state} tone="review" /><MetaPill label="22 inactive gates" /></div><h3><a href={'/evidence/infrastructure-construction-buildings-public-works-territorial-systems/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.project_design_engineering_cost_estimation_permitting_procurement_ledger_id}: {record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Requirements, scope, design, estimates, schedules, permits, delivery models, bids, contracts, market capacity and public value remain unassessed.</p></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Construction, Contractors, Trades, Safety And Inspection</div><h2>Eight construction registers remain inactive.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/construction-safety-quality-inspection-change-control-001/">Read the construction-assurance guide</a></div><div class="source-list">{construction.map((record) => <article class="source-row"><div><h3><a href={'/evidence/infrastructure-construction-buildings-public-works-territorial-systems/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.construction_contractors_trades_materials_safety_inspection_register_id}: {record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Mobilization, contractors, trades, materials, progress, cost, changes, safety, quality, inspections, accessibility and as-builts remain unassessed.</p></div><MetaPill label={record.construction_state} tone="review" /></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Commissioning, Service, Stewardship And Territorial Value</div><h2>Eight stewardship ledgers contain no commissioned-service decision.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/commissioning-accessibility-handover-operations-maintenance-001/">Read the asset-service guide</a></div><div class="grid">{stewardship.map((record) => <article class="record-card"><h3><a href={'/evidence/infrastructure-construction-buildings-public-works-territorial-systems/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.commissioning_accessibility_asset_handover_operations_maintenance_adaptation_reconstruction_territorial_value_ledger_id}: {record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Commissioning, defects, occupancy, accessibility, handover, service, maintenance, adaptation, reconstruction, return, recovery and place value remain inactive.</p><MetaPill label={record.stewardship_state} tone="review" /></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section briefing-band"><div class="briefing-band__copy"><div class="eyebrow">Public Contract</div><h2>Inspect the empty territorial-delivery state.</h2><p>The export publishes the complete control surface without treating plans as executable projects, permits as starts, spending as commissioned assets, substantial completion as safe accessible service, floor area as place value, or reconstruction output as community recovery—and without approving, awarding, constructing, commissioning, scoring, ranking, or changing a stage.</p></div><article class="record-card"><a class="inline-link" href="/data/infrastructure-construction-buildings-public-works-territorial-systems-delivery.json">Infrastructure, construction and territorial-systems JSON</a></article></section>
</BaseLayout>
